<description>&lt;p&gt;Iranian-aligned forces used Russian satellite data to strike targets in Saudi Arabia, while Iran increased pressure on Iraq over the PJAK armed presence. Prime Minister Al-Zaidi’s visit to Damascus revived Iraqi-Syrian tensions over the Sharaa pipeline but also advanced talks on border security and oil links, prompting the Iraqi parliament to consider funding for enhanced air-defense systems. Iraqi security agencies arrested nine suspects on human-trafficking charges and a parliamentarian was sentenced for illegal oil contracts, while the Kurdistan region deepened security coordination with Baghdad and moved forward on weapons-control measures. The conflict produced 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxQalIzVjJueXhFZlN1cnVRXy1kOGpDOWZZc0RSSGhMbnpoTDBkdlQwTFBLQ041QlhFS21vYkhKdnVOcTFpQm05bUxlTUxyaEU0TlFqYkZScWpxWWI1WkxvS1llZnBPWWt4Sl9NY0g4dWNSVkk4S1NWbWl4Tk9zMmNtWFN3YVlBdmY2SWdiRXJveGVtaGV4QkJoYXBBUUNuek9OcDZLdUt2bXdpbE81NDNza3FWeDMyZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Amwaj.media&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;وكالة الانباء العراقية (واع)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxNeEpSd2lnSXNTdERKWXRwSHRyempnb1hwY0RxZmJ6UTUtN3RPU2U5dGRYTVVZVVVuZlhzaW85UTdkQ1lkbk9EeGtGM1F4c2FBYWRyaEFacVhxQjMxQkc3LWZaYVRBZnpEY0VLV2xRT28xcW9JMjV6YmVtTmo1cDJaeDNpdDFxWlhEV3FvVHZlS0Q3TUs0RkZGXw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New Region&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxQbnVtUC00bHkxVGl6TDMtVUlSR3NGaUlEeDFtNFFEbUxSNlhMMGhIY0Z4a1llN25TNklobjAwSXZzaTN4bjRuNHNoclh5Z0o0WHJGMGNZeVVfd2JOQXoxYUxIYXNaOFY5NW9ScnRhX0Y4eDg1WXRvTmRsbGtweUR5bzI4Wnlpd1JtQlcwYk1mV2xBWi1OU0p0a0hIMmNlcnE5NFBBdmNsazM0